WEBVTT

00:03:26.167 --> 00:03:30.143
focuses on technology,
efficiency and speed.

00:03:30.167 --> 00:03:32.226
But if I've learned anything from Cyclops,

00:03:32.250 --> 00:03:36.768
it's that wonders
can be smart, spectacular

00:03:36.792 --> 00:03:38.476
and sustainable --

00:03:38.500 --> 00:03:40.667
because of their mass and their mystery.

00:03:42.000 --> 00:03:45.809
And while people still want to know
how those ancient wonders were built,

00:03:45.833 --> 00:03:48.643
I've been asking Cyclops
how to create the mystery

00:03:48.667 --> 00:03:51.125
that compels people
to ask that very question.

00:03:52.375 --> 00:03:54.434
Because in an era
where we design buildings

00:03:54.458 --> 00:03:57.042
to last 30, maybe 60 years,

00:03:57.875 --> 00:04:00.518
I would love to learn
how to create something